<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has built a 90km road network and opened new bases in southern Lebanon while continuing cross-border incursions, including an Israeli man who entered Lebanon and was returned by UN forces. Israeli airstrikes have hit Qantara and renewed shelling across southern Lebanon, wounding a Lebanese footballer and prompting the detention of a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Hezbollah persists in firing artillery at Israeli positions and has begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. French investigators are probing alleged Israeli war crimes, and protests against Israeli attacks have occurred in Sweden. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNa3hZT1JVVUNpTkJ3U3FEV24zY3hrMHZQajZsZEhGYklYSnVta0lEbUVtRDlvTkhnaFlOUTFubExlT1dnSFFodW1wMzVGWkltdjVMbnh6S1U3R3VyUlZKSkM5V093MHpscjV2YzZaOTZldmpwek5GeGlXZ2JTdWRSci00OGpFMFZLVV92N29MQUlORGJIeUlaQTdQZHVpaUhTSlZwb2hUZDN5R1ZQcjNodGt2b3F5SU1pXzdrbHJzUmEwSDNa?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBMT1BEZWNNdWFzc1E5U0xDY0Q4dXFkQ0kxVXYxaDdTbUtDQVZBV1FjOXJMcUZFUWxiN29zbFZBei1vTG5sZkQ5R1N5RmN1T0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1ZWUFkSjE4dDJXOVo2UGhZMWFjWGZYWkZqOGtXUG9lbU5yWnEwZTRhT1hsaUN1WkpjelRFV0EyS0h5ZlZPcXI2clB5TUk4S2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPaVdjelpCbi10SnFUeXl5anFHLWhuNXg2M05KdERGQk9sb25Ba0JtWTVONDhmS2VmNEpzRFVYbDliX0QyRkpod2pHR1FCRTNmOWpMZVJNLVVXMTNiblFwY2xTNldlTXJFTXBReUxFRVd6UUh3TGt4b19mTDBRdkJzdmxtSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mezha.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;930 WFMD Free Talk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&q